# Professional Wrestler {3}{G}, 4/4: "When this creature enters, create a Treasure token" - exactly one - and "This creature can't be blocked by more
# than one creature" (CR 509.1b). Bot1 casts it turn 1 (Black Lotus's three and Mox Emerald): it leaves a Mox Emerald, the Wrestler and one Treasure.
# On turn 3 it attacks and Bot2's two Ornithopters may not both block it (the refusal) while one may; that Ornithopter dies and the Wrestler takes none.

